OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked after
OL,4,Astarting sexual relationship with woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) officer has been dismissed after
OL,8,Fan investigation found he initiated a
OL,9,Fsexual relationship with a woman he met
OL,10,Fin the course of his duties.
OL,12,FA Police Ombudsman inquiry also found
OL,13,Fhe failed to disclose multiple
OL,14,Fconflicts of interest, intimidated a
OL,15,Fformer partner, attempted to falsify
OL,16,Fevidence and asked a colleague to lie.
OL,18,FOmbudsman Jacqui Durkin said the
OL,19,Fbehaviour was a "catalogue of
OL,20,Fcorruption" which had "the potential to
OL,21,Fdo serious damage to public trust and
OL,22,Fconfidence in policing".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
