OL,5,
OL,6,FThe PSNI said the officer's behaviour
OL,7,Fwas "unacceptable and clearly falls far
OL,8,Fbelow the standards the public rightly
OL,9,Fexpects at all times from police
OL,10,Fofficers and staff".
